- Linux system administration
- Infrastructure documentation and validation

---

## Featured Project

### Virtualized Infrastructure Platform

A production-style virtualized infrastructure environment simulating enterprise network architecture and operational practices.

Key Capabilities

- Multi-VLAN architecture (Management, Servers, IoT, Clients, Guest, VPN)
- Default-deny firewall posture with documented policy design
- Virtual machine provisioning and lifecycle management (Proxmox)
- Containerized services with configuration templating
- Secure VPN access restricted to management plane
- DNS infrastructure with filtering and resolution control
- Documented backup and recovery workflows
- System hardening and operational validation

This project demonstrates real-world infrastructure design, not just service deployment.

